WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.345
Hi, I'm Tello, your compliance assistant.

00:03.695 --> 00:07.665
Tap Ask Tello on your dashboard, or the chat button in the corner.

00:07.815 --> 00:13.875
Ask me to check your facility for DSS gaps, or how any part of Title22 works.

00:14.225 --> 00:19.197
I never give medical or dosage advice. Always check anything that matters.

00:19.847 --> 00:22.459
Now try it: tap Ask Tello.
